{
  "id": "section-length-of-the-game",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Length of the Game\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,360,379]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You will not complete the game in\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,379,413]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "a single session. The game is meant\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,413,449]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to be played as a CAMPAIGN - a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,449,480]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "series of connected missions. Your\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,480,515]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "character will grow and change\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,515,546]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "during these games.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,546,566]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you Play Four Against Darkness\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,566,600]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you play our fantasy game Four\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,600,634]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Against Darkness, you will recognize\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,634,671]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "some mechanics in this game. Be\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,671,703]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "careful because there are\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,703,729]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "important differences:\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,729,752]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1) No levels or classes. A character\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,752,789]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "is created by allocating points and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,789,825]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rolling up random equipment;\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,825,854]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2) Healing is more difficult;\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,854,884]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "3) You have only one character, and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,884,920]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you must keep track of ammunition\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,920,954]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "for all weapons;\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,954,971]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "4) To perform a Defense roll, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,971,1005]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "must roll equal to or higher than\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,1005,1039]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the opponent’s L (not just higher as\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,1039,1076]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "it is in Four Against Darkness);\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,1076,1109]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "5) Spells are not memorized, but\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,1109,1142]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "cast as rituals; each spell has its\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,1142,1178]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "own rules and requirements;\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,1178,1206]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6) There is no distinction between\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,1206,1241]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Ranged and melee combat;\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,1241,1266]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "7) Only d6s are used;\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,1266,1288]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "8) There is no “dungeon” mapping\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,1288,1321]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "but you create a map of a town\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,1321,1352]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "using  “boxes”. Each box represents\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,1352,1388]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "an area, landmark or event. Over a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,1388,1423]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "campaign, you continue exploring\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,1423,1456]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the town, adding more sheets next\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,1456,1490]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0036",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to the previous ones.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,1490,1512]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0037",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "9) There are no XP rolls. XP are\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,1512,1545]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0038",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "points that are accumulated and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,1545,1577]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-length-of-the-game:p0039",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "spent to gain Skills.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[6,1577,1599]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    6
  ]
}
